#: core/templates/core/home.html:10
msgid ""
"Upload daily temperature and rainfall for a station. Climpact checks the "
"data quality, calculates the ET-SCI indices and their trends, and gives you "
"charts, tables and files in the same layout as Climpact in R."
msgstr ""

#: core/templates/core/home.html:16
msgid "Start with your data"
