#: core/templates/core/home.html:100
msgid "About the indices"
msgstr ""

#: core/templates/core/home.html:101
msgid ""
"The indices describe how often, how long and how intensely extremes occur: "
"the hottest day of the year, warm spells, the longest dry period, heavy "
"rainfall and more. They are defined by the Expert Team on Sector-specific "
"Climate Indices (ET-SCI) and calculated the same way as in Climpact for R, "
"so results can be compared between countries."
msgstr ""

#: core/templates/core/home.html:108
msgid ""
"You can also install Climpact on your own computer and use it without an "
"internet connection."
msgstr ""

#: core/templates/core/home.html:110
